   "en": "An operation that takes a table and returns a table in which one row still means the same kind of thing. Filling a blank rent, rewriting 'GAZA' as 'Gaza' and dropping the 14 repeated listings are all transformations: afterwards one row is still one advert for one flat, even though the row count fell from 503 to 489.",
